# Isolated live-test scratch (contains copied settings with API keys — never commit)
/scratch/
# live-testing.md's harness is run from backend/ (`cd backend && ...`), so its
# scratch dirs land at backend/scratch/ — the root-anchored /scratch/ above
# never matched them (found live, S019: backend/scratch/ sat untracked and
# unignored with a copied settings.json carrying real API keys).
backend/scratch/

